    "BUN-RED-4"
  ],
  "provenance": {
    "type": "spec",
    "note": "The export has an empty permit, so the bundle withholds the bytes of d1. Its raw form has no entry and lists the digest in withheld (BUN-RAW-1). BUN-RAW-5 applies BUN-IMP-9, so the device store keeps d1 without bytes and the import is ok."
  },
